'''Girlish Innocents''' (乙女, ''Otome'', '''Maiden''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (M): Cat Base health is increased by 50%.

